      "title": "feat: the built-in pad can be a Steam Controller to Steam",
      "summary": "Adds Steam Controller as a third choice for how Steam sees the built-in pad (Mode settings \u2192 Controller), next to Steam Deck controller and Xbox 360.",
      "publishedAt": 1791689546000
    },
    {
      "commit": "910fb47692d68041de19f5d75c5d172dd62ceb60",
      "title": "fix: the Steam Controller's hidraw node reaches the input shim again",
      "summary": "The fix registers the descriptor (watchfd) when the Steam Controller node opens and unregisters it (unwatchfd) if setup fails, matching the Deck and touch nodes.",
      "publishedAt": 1791689343000
    },
    {
      "commit": "3dd14dd62587e3c8022b6d8af3e14bac36017024",
      "title": "refactor: Steam always runs in Deck mode on the Deck beta branch",
      "summary": "Deck mode and the steamdeckpublicbeta branch have been the default for a while, and turning either off no longer helps anyone. This removes both options and the code behind them, so every Steam session runs the way almost everyone already runs it.",
      "publishedAt": 1791685477000
    },
    {
