      "title": "Windows components: picked automatically by each game's source",
      "summary": "Each game's Windows components now come from the list its own source trusts, and the ones that list names turn on by themselves. The user's own on/off switches always win, and each automatic row says why it is on.",
      "publishedAt": 1791681785000
    },
